.02,"end":502.44},{"text":"the","start":502.44,"end":502.6},{"text":"mantra","start":502.6,"end":502.92},{"text":"to","start":502.92,"end":503.22},{"text":"Shri","start":503.22,"end":503.62},{"text":"Nirvichara.","start":503.62,"end":504.86}]},{"text":"Nirvichara means thoughtless awareness.","start":505.84,"end":508.98,"words":[{"text":"Nirvichara","start":505.84,"end":506.54},{"text":"means","start":506.54,"end":507.02},{"text":"thoughtless","start":507.02,"end":507.94},{"text":"awareness.","start":507.94,"end":508.98}]},{"text":"So we can also say the mantra to try and invoke thoughtless awareness.","start":510.6,"end":514.74,"words":[{"text":"So","start":510.6,"end":510.64},{"text":"we","start":510.64,"end":510.78},{"text":"can","start":510.78,"end":511.02},{"text":"also","start":511.02,"end":511.16},{"text":"say","start":511.16,"end":511.44},{"text":"the","start":511.44,"end":511.58},{"text":"mantra","start":511.58,"end":511.84},{"text":"to","start":511.84,"end":512.18},{"text":"try","start":512.18,"end":512.6},{"text":"and","start":512.6,"end":512.92},{"text":"invoke","start":512.92,"end":513.3},{"text":"thoughtless","start":513.3,"end":514.18},{"text":"awareness.","start":514.18,"end":514.74}]},{"text":"We can put our right hand on the top of the head, the Sahasrara, the 7th chakra, and we can together say the mantra to Shri Nirvichara.","start":516.34,"end":528.82,"words":[{"text":"We","start":516.34,"end":516.5},{"text":"can","start":516.5,"end":516.62},{"text":"put","start":516.62,"end":516.84},{"text":"our","start":516.84,"end":517.02},{"text":"right","start":517.02,"end":517.22},{"text":"hand","start":517.22,"end":517.64},{"text":"on","start":517.64,"end":517.86},{"text":"the","start":517.86,"end":518.04},{"text":"top","start":518.04,"end":518.26},{"text":"of","start":518.26,"end":518.54},{"text":"the","start":518.54,"end":518.74},{"text":"head,","start":518.74,"end":519.44},{"text":"the","start":519.72,"end":519.8},{"text":"Sahasrara,","start":519.8,"en